#. copy/lead
#: src/js/fieldwork.js:47
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Twenty-four stations have their own entry rules, supervisors, and "
"complications. Obtain dispatch, check in, respond when something refuses to "
"follow the plan, then return with observations, provenance, and a decision "
"on research use."
msgstr ""
"Twenty-four stations have their own entry rules, supervisors, and "
"complications. Obtain dispatch, check in, respond when something refuses to "
"follow the plan, then return with observations, provenance, and a decision "
"on research use."

